ERMINED`：同时有多个或没有 `generating` 会话。把列出的候选（ID、状态、更新时间、标题）给用户，按标题让用户确认，不要自己挑。\n- `sidebar ... NOT FOUND`，或候选里没有当前会话：这张表只记录 **Spec 模式**会话，普通 Agent 会话通常没有记录。如实说\"未找到 Spec 会话记录\"。普通会话的侧边栏 ID 是否等于引擎 sessionUuid **未经验证**，不要说成同一个值。\n\n## 数据来源（供解释与排错）\n\n| 值 | 位置 | 识别方式 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 引擎 sessionUuid | `~/.comate/builtin-hook-state/notify-dispatcher.log`（JSON 行） | 每次工具调用结束后依次写 `start`（含 `event=PostToolUse`、`conversationId`）、`loadWatch`（含会话 `cwd`）、`record`（含 `toolName`，Bash 为 `run_command`）；按 `cwd` 过滤工作区，按时间对齐第 1 步 |\n| 侧边栏会话 ID | `<IDE 用户目录>/workspaceStorage/<hash>/state.vscdb`，表 `ItemTable`，key `comateAgentEditor.session.<id>` | `<hash>` 目录下 `workspace.json` 的 `folder` 指向当前工作区；value 是 JSON，含 `sessionId`、`title`、`iconStatus`、`updatedAt` |\n\nIDE 用户目录：macOS `~/Library/Application Support/Comate/User`，Linux `~/.config/Comate/User`，Windows `%APPDATA%\\Comate\\User`。\n\n不要把 `User/History/` 或 `chatEditingSessions/` 里出现的 ID 当作依据：那是 IDE 的本地历史和编辑快照，可能来自其他会话写过的文件，原文件删掉后快照依然存在。\n","metadata":{"relativePath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/SKILL.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/SKILL.md","resolution":"absolute","skillName":"comate-session-ids","skillPath":"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids"}}}]},{"id":"6ad59aede31d831970375449","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":12920},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01DsGDedjvtAjUGavPE3jDKM","type":"TOOL","toolName":"run_command","params":{"command":"python3 ~/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py --stamp","description":"Record timestamp for session ID lookup","prefix_rule":"[\"python3\",\"/Users/bress/.comate/skills/comate-session-ids/scripts/session_ids.py\"]"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"Command executed successfully.\nExit code: 0\nOutput:\n1792383737956\n","metadata":{"cwd":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec102","autoRun":true,"state":"completed","runMode":"yolo","taskId":"hp2o0e","output":"17923